    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Having considered the materials on record prima facie disclosing involvement of the petitioners in dealing in rotten food items which are deleterious for human consumption since the forensic report notes that the seized items as \"rotten flesh\" clearly giving an impression of noxious character and in view of the fact that date has been fixed for consideration of charge, we are of the opinion that this is not a fit case to grant bail to the petitioner at this stage.",
